      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think a friends-only chatbox setting is great for filtering out spam from nearby people, especially since non-friends could attempt to use the chatbox for griefing.  I imagine that this is the reason why chatboxes are turned off by default, you turn it on at your own risk.  \n\nFor a private person-to-person direct chat, I think that some sort of Instant Messaging apparatus would be more appropriate, which is something I fully endorse.  We shouldn't have to rely on external programs to communicate that way.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-07T20:47:08.884Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The Chatbox should have an option, for toggling Friends-Only and Public visibility. This way you can talk about private stuff while still being in a public lobby",
